OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 JUN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,5,     FShostakoviches
OL,6,     GChris Addison explores the life
OL,7,     Gand work of Zara Levina - a
OL,8,     Gcomposer still virtually unknown
OL,9,     Gin the West, whose music had to
OL,10,     Gbattle Soviet gender stereotypes
OL,11,     Gduring her lifetime.
OL,12,G2200FLate Junction
OL,13,     GVerity Sharp focuses in on the
OL,14,     Gfiner points of experimental
OL,15,     Gmusic, sharing ear-bending sounds
OL,16,     Gfrom today's most adventurous
OL,17,     Gmusicians.
